{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "5bd5218d5d0459e4bc8996a880ef9659df2f0837d4d9f54d49ad2a9fc3f2106a", "ja": "ハジけきれない、ふたり", "zh": "无法彻底放开的两人", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ffa60ca61232e35bfb2b46089fd5633d5072b534cdf3ba74146ffe023083b4e6", "ja": "失恋でハジケる気持ちがわからず、1人で\n特訓する雪歩。琴葉も合流し、2人で海に\n向かって叫ぶ。プロデューサーが陰ながら\n見守る中、男性2人組が近づいてきて……。", "zh": "无法理解失恋后彻底放飞的心情，雪步1个人\n展开了特训。随后琴叶也加入进来，2人一起朝向\n大海呐喊。就在制作人在暗中\n守护着她们时，有2名男子靠了过来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1000_null", "source_sha256": "ade02e4c64c2d4b391c9f976cad378973fa112398de64d77e61cd18f8c7edca7", "ja": "その頃……", "zh": "与此同时……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2a29f970fee0651bb121e74c4bc99323a9162cc8b52d0894dbdaa359825bfa71", "ja": "は、はーーじーーけーーろーーーー！！", "zh": "放、放——飞——吧————！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d20f7215e3406190010864f04b65f3d3376771b624bc5e68ff0c7032be457ae9", "ja": "ううっ、やっぱり、全然ハジけられてない……。\n私には無理なのかも……。", "zh": "呜呜，果然还是完全没能放开来……\n也许我真的做不到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "13504f058d39af443a938579d340a5a04576530c64ce0e47dc30c2fb9a76bd10", "ja": "そもそも私なんかが、し、失恋なんて、\nおこがましいって思うし……。", "zh": "说到底，像我这样的人谈、谈什么失恋，\n我觉得根本就是不自量力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f4e5251d1984bce60b01f1704d0f4792c969299dc24c59f5b5d165843a0282fa", "ja": "私が失恋しても、せいぜい、真っ暗な部屋で\nポエムを書くのがお似合いなんじゃ……うう……。", "zh": "就算我失恋了，顶多也就是待在漆黑的房间里写写诗……这才是适合我的……呜呜……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "c08ec56666ece62a01a88a6e76c2812fa2ccfc8891404b868ccce648438fd42b", "ja": "今の声……やっぱり。雪歩ちゃん！", "zh": "刚才的声音……果然是。雪步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9f3498336ea14fc747335ac33098fe5b222c6d37b8bc72b662028656c1fc3aa5", "ja": "あっ、琴葉ちゃん！？\nどうしてここに……？", "zh": "啊，琴叶！？\n你怎么会在这里……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "926a0ae555c8267b57d516ec4c5ee36416914e7ffb66c3de96b0fb92cbcf3908", "ja": "雪歩ちゃんが、外に出て行くのが見えたから……\n外は暗いし、心配で。", "zh": "因为我看到雪步出门去了……\n外面天又黑，我有点担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "f20ac59bc4d560c400c51b85a9e8f2ed449e8a965e2b4be40e880617bdc3a2fb", "ja": "けど、急に大きな声がしてきたから、\nビックリしちゃった。", "zh": "可是，突然传来了很大的声音，吓了我一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7c54befe5c8a38306bc2416009c170701af568a4fa0759d7e8e90a08c64759ee", "ja": "わ、私……まだ全然、失恋でハジける気持ちが\nわからなくて。昼間の特訓もダメダメだったし……。", "zh": "我、我……还完全弄不明白\n因失恋而放飞自我的心情。白天的特训也完全不行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "07b0b17ad61ff5a5eef5efd0dbe916d6040525b158d5ea7cf3e5b5016c7107bf", "ja": "失恋どころか、\n恋愛のスタートにも立てた気がしなくて……。", "zh": "别说失恋了，\n我感觉自己甚至连恋爱的起跑线都没能站上去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "e6843da90079cd1075b9514b913b8d01ba9c5c00707ff7b78d01079303b6fb90", "ja": "私も……失恋して落ち込むんじゃなく、\nハジける気持ち。どうしたらわかるんだろうって……。", "zh": "我也是……不想因为失恋而消沉，而是想要拥有那种迸发的心情。我想知道该怎么做才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "70f3383afe971b9c1b3060c40a32cb7dc32e90acf4f7fa1461ddbb68ab596edb", "ja": "琴葉ちゃん……。", "zh": "琴叶……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "b404f5d9615c3993b4f1500d1955031281d968b9acdef1a76862dc47cdc8a59f", "ja": "特訓、一緒にしてもいいかな？", "zh": "可以和你一起特训吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1014_004yuk", "source_sha256": "78a9cee1246eba112600920c19116070667bed3b1afe1066dec1357ec679c3cd", "ja": "う、うんっ！　もちろんだよ！", "zh": "嗯、嗯！当然可以！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ac435cdbf051882e70758e9e0dedcd243175571f1246c5952c5cb7ce5f2079f0", "ja": "はーーーーじーーーーけーーーーろーーーー！", "zh": "尽ーーーー情ーーーー绽ーーーー放ーーーー吧ーーーー！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "ac435cdbf051882e70758e9e0dedcd243175571f1246c5952c5cb7ce5f2079f0", "ja": "はーーーーじーーーーけーーーーろーーーー！", "zh": "尽ーーーー情ーーーー绽ーーーー放ーーーー吧ーーーー！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1018_p", "source_sha256": "7058e78df7ebb57661f5412e5f3efc75941d754775112179982ecee1eb394436", "ja": "（ふたりとも、こんな所で特訓の続きをしていたのか。\n想像以上に、真剣だったんだな……）", "zh": "（原来你们两个在这种地方继续特训啊。\n比我想象中还要认真呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a32c340711a5cb972879fc902c8257152724157aa9c7f305c2c6913655661beb", "ja": "（今止めたら、ふたりの自主性に水を差すかもしれない\n……少し離れた所から、見守るとするか）", "zh": "（现在要是阻止她们，说不定会打击她们的自主性……还是在稍微远一点的地方守望吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1020_004yuk", "source_sha256": "de1b972351d8124ebba85217249de0dc1de5b1c08ff995e28b1931e63d798ebc", "ja": "うう……あんまり、変わった気がしないかも……。", "zh": "呜呜……总觉得，好像没什么变化呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1021_017kth", "source_sha256": "a7c4725b33a5698f8fb4489a551c62b81c6ccb2ddfb5548c0d262a673d274278", "ja": "そうだね……。\n思いきって、セリフを変えてみるとか？", "zh": "是啊……\n要不要干脆试着把台词改一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1022_017kth", "source_sha256": "ccd9992a9e9188682cb94534d5e307d4816b1becaee94d9e1531dbf19da4836a", "ja": "莉緒さんと真美ちゃんだったら、\nこんな時、なんて叫ぶんだろう……？", "zh": "如果是莉绪姐和真美的话，在这种时候，她们会喊些什么呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1023_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ffc421d6287d0b9e32470942d3cd454b30bb09536453e5834cfd467c736d1916", "ja": "莉緒さんと真美ちゃんなら……\nやっぱり、セクシーかな？", "zh": "要是莉绪姐和真美的话……果然会是性感路线吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "be0326d0731ffeeed26a79e28b930fc34fd05d036750ac8c89886028507b5f42", "ja": "ふふっ、そうかも。\nなら、『ハジけろ、セクシー！』でいこう！", "zh": "呵呵，说不定真是这样。\n那就用“绽放吧，性感！”来定了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1025_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5d09dc6d4cc4b716527147da2572ce70994cbc3048412fe038585497ae09023d", "ja": "うん！　……せーのっ。", "zh": "嗯！……预备—— 马会?", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1026_017kth", "source_sha256": "af615165d55821e81a04a99028e2dc5c50752041604f62165d8c2b3a7fed5cff", "ja": "ハジけろ、セクシーーーーーー！", "zh": "释放吧，性感——————！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1027_004yuk", "source_sha256": "af615165d55821e81a04a99028e2dc5c50752041604f62165d8c2b3a7fed5cff", "ja": "ハジけろ、セクシーーーーーー！", "zh": "释放吧，性感——————！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1028_017kth", "source_sha256": "3dc2ec1c1a41c6a45b20de07d691a36513b918bfc7257f65baaf50f4639f64aa", "ja": "はあ……こんな感じかな？\nちょっと、恥ずかしいけど。", "zh": "唉……大概是这种感觉吧？\n虽然有点不好意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1029_017kth", "source_sha256": "885500c143d872d6c0aa0caa29afb277ef6f9ff7b4448404aad89e2658824dbe", "ja": "でも、気持ちはまだわからないままだね。\nやっぱり、莉緒さんに教えてもらわないと難しいかも。", "zh": "不过，还是没能明白这种感觉呢。\n果然，可能还是得请莉绪姐教我才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1030_004yuk", "source_sha256": "099af35b8c2ec93d1cfd728ff9036a13f7b4d46bd2a1ea5a0f177cdbb68fcc6d", "ja": "ご、ごめんね、琴葉ちゃん。\n私の特訓に付き合わせちゃって……。", "zh": "对、对不起，琴叶。\n还让你陪我一起特训……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1031_017kth", "source_sha256": "c65e12ecacdc845b3fa4348e28d98de1b4b449a500afd58fbe6afb0a9b3469fb", "ja": "ううん！　わからないのは、私も同じだし……\nだから、一緒に考えていこう！", "zh": "没事的！不明白的地方我也一样……\n所以，我们一起思考吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1032_004yuk", "source_sha256": "325b9d75d6c3e1d415d02a4361e535d8b288bf442056de4604d42953b7768aef", "ja": "琴葉ちゃん……う、うん。そうだよね！", "zh": "琴叶……嗯、嗯。说得也是呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1033_otoko1", "source_sha256": "032151bd6c5c7740e5a981d197b4440a0011859ac1310710c37655eaf436a376", "ja": "あれれ～。\nこんな所に女の子だけで、なにしてるの～？", "zh": "哎呀呀～\n几个女孩子待在种地方，在做什么呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1034_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7dadead7d021b465e4c91634410fc596e2d161415f09bd9ec7781927d1896b2e", "ja": "ひゃあっ！？　お、男の人……！", "zh": "呀！？ 男、男生……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1035_p", "source_sha256": "ca39bc19b4f493f20b9a612690b8467e17469989f748cae655c4c116cae0dd77", "ja": "あっ！　……雪歩、琴葉！", "zh": "啊！……雪步、琴叶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1036_otoko2", "source_sha256": "8808643e158935a39dc0a1238e721adc5948cdc25a521a0d8442c876a22ac836", "ja": "俺らもさ～、男同士で来ててつまんないんだよね～。\nどう？　あっちで一緒にバーベキューしない？", "zh": "我们几个也是啊～，全是男的一起来，挺没意思的～。\n怎么样？要不要一起去那边吃烧烤？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1037_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e6031e2e9c0a7a0cf3ebcb45d07091fd9d1ec9fffd6c30262ef566f8ccb53de8", "ja": "あ、うう……、あの、その……。", "zh": "啊，不、不用了……那个、这个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1038_017kth", "source_sha256": "69fb0921d38b5675baa55502c692bc9a72843f9af3f19c55db3a68acf6d3dc49", "ja": "あの、結構ですっ。私たち、特訓中なので！", "zh": "那个，不用了。我们正在特训呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_04_1039_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5071c0a89f75cc03cdce35defe2d4e0b2ad6fcedd852bbae3d65ceca6b982b85", "ja": "こ、琴葉ちゃん……！", "zh": "琴、琴叶……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
